@startuml sequence_logout
title Logout Flow (FR-006, SEC-005)

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend

User -> Frontend : select "Log out"
Frontend -> Frontend : write logout_intent = true\nto localStorage
Frontend -> Frontend : clear in-memory access_token and\nauthenticated-user state\n(CSRF token retained for this request)
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/v1/auth/logout/\nX-CSRFToken: <csrf_token>\n(no bearer token required)

alt refresh_token cookie valid
  Backend -> Backend : invalidate refresh token\n(ADS-FR-006-02, ADS-FR-007-09)
else expired / revoked / already invalid / missing
  Backend -> Backend : no-op (idempotent)
end

Backend --> Frontend : 204 No Content\nclear refresh_token cookie
Frontend -> User : navigate to login page\n(on success, failure, or unreachable backend)

note over Backend
  A bearer access token already issued before
  logout remains valid until its own 10-minute
  expiry (ADS-FR-006-09) — an accepted, bounded
  exposure window, not a defect.
end note

User -> Frontend : next successful login
Frontend -> Frontend : remove logout_intent marker

@enduml
